==============================================================================
Code ported from BIMCraft
==============================================================================

crates/world/src/skeleton.rs is ported from BIMCraft
(https://github.com/IPedrax/bimcraft), crates/core/src/skeleton.rs and the
vector type and three helpers it uses from crates/core/src/geom.rs, at commit
f202abd85d1cf165325e2f7b250da0b5e51f5b71. BIMCraft is licensed MIT OR
Apache-2.0; the code is used here under the MIT license. The file's header
states that it is ported and lists what was changed.

The building model is ported from the same project at the same commit, under
the same license:

  crates/world/src/building/model.rs    from crates/core/src/model.rs and
                                        crates/core/src/family.rs
  crates/world/src/building/walls.rs    from crates/core/src/walls.rs
  crates/world/src/building/runs.rs     from crates/core/src/runs.rs
  crates/world/src/building/network.rs  from crates/core/src/network.rs
  crates/world/src/building/rooms.rs    from crates/core/src/geom.rs,
                                        crates/core/src/rooms.rs and
                                        crates/core/src/model.rs
  crates/world/src/building.rs          five small items from
                                        crates/core/src/model.rs and
                                        crates/core/src/view3d.rs; the rest of
                                        the file is this project's own

What draws and edits the building is ported from the same project at the same
commit, under the same license:

  crates/world/src/editing/history.rs   from crates/core/src/engine.rs
  crates/world/src/editing.rs           the verbs' rules, from
                                        crates/core/src/commands.rs and
                                        crates/core/src/engine.rs; the file is
                                        otherwise this project's own

Each file's header states what is ported and lists what was changed. PORTMAP.md
names, for every public item of the building model, the BIMCraft file and line
it came from, or that it is this project's own and how that was checked.

